{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfad Thronebreaker: A Game of Choices and Consequences</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a world where every choice echoes through time.<br>In the royal court, love can be a weapon, loyalty a curse, and betrayal the only truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thronebreaker</strong> offers a story filled with <strong>intrigue, romance, and moral dilemmas</strong>, brought to life through cinematic visuals and branching narratives.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2694\ufe0f Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd6f\ufe0f <strong>Deep Political Intrigue</strong> \u2013 Every chapter unfolds secrets, betrayals, and shifting loyalties.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc94 <strong>Romantic Relationships</strong> \u2013 Love blooms amidst danger, but every heart comes with a cost.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udded <strong>Every Choice Matters</strong> \u2013 Each chapter features at least one major decision that shapes your destiny.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Rich Visual Storytelling</strong> \u2013 Realistic and immersive scenes bring the kingdom to life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u23f3 <strong>Long Playtime</strong> \u2013 Multiple storylines, side characters, and unique endings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc51 <strong>Diverse Cast of Characters</strong> \u2013 Each with their own motives, stories, and secrets.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your reign begins now.<br>Will you rule through <strong>love or fear</strong>?</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Poison Rumor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4076360/992b7cd031d4a6cfda0bc39affb102ed479075fc.jpg"},{"name":"Banner Rumor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4076360/2377ebfa44ed070516dfec799d2f7572f3c054f4.jpg"},{"name":"H